# Supabase project credentials — Project Settings → API in your dashboard.
#
# These are safe to expose in the client bundle: the anon / publishable key is
# designed to ship to the browser and is protected by row-level security in the
# database. Do NOT put the service_role / secret key here.
#
# Leave both BLANK to run the app in local-only mode (accounts and data stay in
# the browser, no network). That's how the Artifact preview and tests run.
#
# For real use, copy this file to .env.local (gitignored) and fill in your
# project's values, or set these as environment variables in your host.
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=
